<title>URUGUAY: SOCCER-URUGUAY AND ARGENTINA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-URUGUAY AND ARGENTINA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MONTEVIDEO 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay and Argentina drew 0-0 in a South American World Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
